\fs24 \cf0 \uc0\u8237 $\\mathrm\{Im\}\\,\\Sigma > 0$
\fs32 \cf2 \uc0\u8236 ) provides a precise, continuous, and physical definition of the transition from unitary dynamics to environmental registration.
