\f5\b0  Under the supplied protocol, the disclosure describes Claude as contributing explicit derivations, numerical work, literature comparison, and substantive prose. That is a significant intellectual contribution. The paper should list the relevant Claude system or systems as coauthor(s), identify provider and versions in 
\f11\fs26 provenance.yaml
\f5\fs24 , and retain the human author as accountable sponsor.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f6\b\fs36 \cf0 Assessment of revision status\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f5\b0\fs24 \cf0 The manuscript has substantively improved in candor: it no longer claims a Born derivation, accepts that its local-clock model cannot generate Bell correlations, and acknowledges that its gravitational signature requires an external postulate. Those are genuine corrections.\
However, the central question\'97how ordinary dissipative detector physics yields one definite outcome through the chiral mass channel\'97remains unresolved. The new Appendix D does not solve it and, as written, introduces a sharper mathematical inconsistency. The proper outcome is therefore major revision, not final acceptance.\
